q("fe-213", C, 2, PAT, "A boy pulls a stretched elastic band and lets go. A small ball placed against the band shoots out. What does the force from the band do to the ball?", "It makes the ball start to move and speeds it up", [W("It makes the ball stop moving", "wrong-effect", "The ball was still, and then it shoots away."), W("It makes the ball slow down", "wrong-effect", "The ball moves faster, not slower."), W("It changes the shape of the ball for ever", "wrong-effect", "The ball keeps its shape. It moves.")], ["The stretched band pushes the ball, so the ball goes from still to moving fast."], None)
